"_blank" title="Our channel is your ultimate destination for all things related to freight forwarding, supply chain optimization, business improvement, and entrepreneurship. "><div class="avatar-img"><img loading="lazy" decoding="async" class="img lazyload" src="https://chnprice-hk.oss-cn-hongkong.aliyuncs.com/index_tutorial/Forceget Supply Chain Logistics - Burak Yolga.png"></div><span class="title">Forceget Supply Chain Logistics - Burak Yolga </span></a></li></ul></div></div></div></section><!--培训  --END--><!--收款支付--><section class="section mt-3"><div class="section-container"><div class="white-bg round"><div class="ai-module-header"><h3 class="title">Payment Solutions</h3></div><div class="ai-module-body"><ul class="ai-list"><li class="ai-item"><a class="ai-link" target="_blank" rel="nofollow" href="https://www.aiprice.com/Index/detail.html?url=https%3A%2F%2Fportal.worldfirst.com.cn%2Fregister%2Fsubmit%3FproductType%3DE_COMMERCE%26progress%3Drollout&ext_id=10221&q=1&t=1718167711953&tep=XXNNPXQXN616263&cn=e-c&from=random_link"><div class="ai-item-logo"><img loading="lazy" decoding="async" class="ai-item-logo-img lazyload" src="https://cn01.aiprice.com/static/index/img/payment/worldfirst.png"></div><div class="ai-info"><h6 class="ai-item-title">万里汇 (WorldFirst)</h6><span class="ai-item-desc">全球电商 一站收付</span></div></a></li><li class="ai-item"><a class="ai-link" target="_blank" rel="nofollow" href="https://www.aiprice.com/Index/detail.html?url=https%3A%2F%2Fportal.worldfirst.com%2Fregister%3Futm_source%3Dcn_website&ext_id=10221&q=1&t=1718167711953&tep=XXNNPXQXN616263&cn=e-c&from=random_link"><div class="ai-item-logo"><img loading="lazy" decoding="async" class="ai-item-logo-img lazyload" src="https://cn01.aiprice.com/static/index/img/payment/worldfirst.jpg"></div><div class="ai-info"><h6 class="ai-item-title">                                        WorldFirst B2B
                                    </h6><span class="ai-item-desc">Powered by Ant Group. Fees capped at 0.3%, with instant settlement!</span></div></a></li><li class="ai-item"><a class="ai-link" target="_blank" rel="nofollow" href="https://www.aiprice.com/Index/detail.html?url=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.airwallex.com%2F&ext_id=10221&q=1&t=1718167711953&tep=XXNNPXQXN616263&cn=e-c&from=random_link"><div class="ai-item-logo"><img loading="lazy" decoding="async" class="ai-item-logo-img lazyload" src="https://cn01.aiprice.com/static/index/img/payment/airwallex.png"></div><div class="ai-info"><h6 class="ai-item-title">Airwallex空中云汇</h6><span class="ai-item-desc">120天电商收款提现0费率</span></div></a></li><li class="ai-item"><a class="ai-link" target="_blank" rel="nofollow" href="https://www.aiprice.com/Index/detail.html?url=https%3A%2F%2Fglobalpay.163.com&ext_id=10221&q=1&t=1718167711953&tep=XXNNPXQXN616263&cn=e-c&from=random_link"><div class="ai-item-logo"><img loading="lazy" decoding="async" class="ai-item-logo-img lazyload" src="https://cn01.aiprice.com/static/index/img/payment/163-pay.png"></div><div class="ai-info"><h6 class="ai-item-title">网易支付</h6><span class="ai-item-desc">网易官方出品，亚马逊收款首选，0汇损所见所得</span></div></a></li><li class="ai-item"><a class="ai-link" target="_blank" rel="nofollow" href="https://www.aiprice.com/Index/detail.html?url=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.payoneer.com%2Fgo%2F%3Frid%3DA7D458AD-4E88-471A-A7E5-E161A6B3D294&ext_id=10221&q=1&t=1718167711953&tep=XXNNPXQXN616263&cn=e-c&from=random_link"><div class="ai-item-logo"><img loading="lazy" decoding="async" class="ai-item-logo-img lazyload" src="https://cn01.aiprice.com/static/index/img/payment/payoneer.png"></div><div class="ai-info"><h6 class="ai-item-title">Payoneer派安盈</h6><span class="ai-item-desc">本地账号免汇损，多币种转换，灵活银行提现，采购费随心付</span></div></a></li><li class="ai-item"><a class="ai-link" target="_blank" rel="nofollow" href="https://www.aiprice.com/Index/detail.html?url=https%3A%2F%2Fglobal.lianlianpay.com%2F&ext_id=10221&q=1&t=17